{
    "_comment": [
        "Offline configuration. Two rules govern the URLs in this file.",
        "",
        "1. Everything here is BROWSER-facing, so paths are root-relative.",
        "   That is deliberate: a relative path follows whatever origin the",
        "   page was loaded from, so the app keeps working if the box is",
        "   reached as localhost, as a LAN IP, or through another proxy.",
        "",
        "2. The STAC catalog is the exception and uses absolute hrefs built",
        "   from PUBLIC_ORIGIN at seed time, because those same hrefs are read",
        "   server-side by the MCP server and rewritten to s3:// for DuckDB.",
        "   A relative path is meaningless to a process with no page origin.",
        "   Consequence: PUBLIC_ORIGIN must match the URL in the address bar,",
        "   or child collections 404 while this top-level file looks fine.",
        "",
        "3. `geocoder.enabled: false` must be stated, not implied. Upstream",
        "   computes `geoCfg.enabled !== false`, so an ABSENT geocoder block",
        "   leaves the `geocode` agent tool REGISTERED, and the agent then",
        "   calls nominatim.openstreetmap.org mid-conversation — a live network",
        "   dependency at request time, which is the one thing this box must",
        "   not have. Omitting a key is not the same as disabling a feature;",
        "   check the upstream default before trusting an absence.",
        "",
        "Features off on purpose, not by oversight: geocoder (Nominatim and",
        "Photon are both remote), voice transcription (needs a speech model",
        "this box does not ship), and upload (writes to object storage that is",
        "read-only here). See docs/offline.md.",
        "",
        "FIELD NAMES ARE THE SOURCE'S, NOT OURS. These layers are mirrored from",
        "the public-census catalog, so tooltips and styles reference upstream",
        "column names (MHHI, TotPop, NAMELSAD) rather than tidied-up ones. Only",
        "the block-group layer carries demographics at all; state, county and",
        "tract are boundaries with TIGER attributes only. Naming a column that",
        "is not in the TILES renders blank with no error, so check against",
        "`pmtiles show --metadata` before adding one."
    ],
    "catalog": "/data/geo-data/stac/catalog.json",
    "titiler_url": "/titiler",
    "mcp_url": "/mcp",
    "auto_approve": true,
    "upload_enabled": false,
    "draw_enabled": true,
    "charts": {
        "enabled": true
    },
    "geolocate": {
        "button": false,
        "agent_tool": false
    },
    "geocoder": {
        "enabled": false,
        "search_box": false
    },
    "sidebar": {
        "enabled": true,
        "chat_title": "Ask about US census data"
    },
    "view": {
        "center": [
            -98.5,
            39.5
        ],
        "zoom": 4
    },
    "links": {
        "github": "https://github.com/SchmidtDSE/glen-in-a-box",
        "carbon": false
    },
    "welcome": {
        "message": "This is a fully offline copy of the US census explorer — the map, the database, and the language model all run on this machine, with no internet connection. Demographics are ACS 2020–2024 five-year estimates at block-group level. A local 8B model answers these, so give it a moment; simple, specific questions work best. Try asking:",
        "examples": [
            "Show the 10 block groups with the highest median household income in California.",
            "What is the total population of block groups in San Francisco County?",
            "Colour the map by per-capita income.",
            "How many block groups have no median household income reported?"
        ]
    },
    "collections": [
        {
            "collection_id": "us-census-blockgroups",
            "collection_url": "/data/geo-data/stac/us-census-blockgroups/collection.json",
            "group": "ACS demographics",
            "assets": [
                {
                    "id": "pmtiles",
                    "display_name": "Block groups — median household income",
                    "visible": true,
                    "default_style": {
                        "fill-color": [
                            "step",
                            [
                                "coalesce",
                                [
                                    "get",
                                    "MHHI"
                                ],
                                -1
                            ],
                            "#E0E0E0",
                            0,
                            "#EFF3FF",
                            40000,
                            "#C6DBEF",
                            60000,
                            "#9ECAE1",
                            85000,
                            "#6BAED6",
                            115000,
                            "#3182BD",
                            175000,
                            "#08519C"
                        ],
                        "fill-opacity": 0.85
                    },
                    "tooltip_fields": [
                        "NAMELSAD",
                        "TotPop",
                        "MHHI",
                        "PCI",
                        "PovInd"
                    ],
                    "legend_type": "categorical",
                    "legend_classes": [
                        {
                            "label": "No data",
                            "color": "#E0E0E0"
                        },
                        {
                            "label": "under $40k",
                            "color": "#EFF3FF"
                        },
                        {
                            "label": "$40k – $60k",
                            "color": "#C6DBEF"
                        },
                        {
                            "label": "$60k – $85k",
                            "color": "#9ECAE1"
                        },
                        {
                            "label": "$85k – $115k",
                            "color": "#6BAED6"
                        },
                        {
                            "label": "$115k – $175k",
                            "color": "#3182BD"
                        },
                        {
                            "label": "$175k and over",
                            "color": "#08519C"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "collection_id": "us-census-tracts",
            "collection_url": "/data/geo-data/stac/us-census-tracts/collection.json",
            "group": "Census geographies",
            "assets": [
                {
                    "id": "pmtiles",
                    "display_name": "Census tracts",
                    "visible": false,
                    "default_style": {
                        "fill-color": "#000000",
                        "fill-opacity": 0
                    },
                    "outline_style": {
                        "line-color": "#78909C",
                        "line-width": 0.4,
                        "line-opacity": 0.7
                    },
                    "tooltip_fields": [
                        "NAMELSAD",
                        "GEOID"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "collection_id": "us-census-counties",
            "collection_url": "/data/geo-data/stac/us-census-counties/collection.json",
            "group": "Census geographies",
            "assets": [
                {
                    "id": "pmtiles",
                    "display_name": "Counties",
                    "visible": true,
                    "default_style": {
                        "fill-color": "#000000",
                        "fill-opacity": 0
                    },
                    "outline_style": {
                        "line-color": "#546E7A",
                        "line-width": 0.6,
                        "line-opacity": 0.8
                    },
                    "tooltip_fields": [
                        "NAMELSAD",
                        "GEOID"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "collection_id": "us-census-states",
            "collection_url": "/data/geo-data/stac/us-census-states/collection.json",
            "group": "Census geographies",
            "assets": [
                {
                    "id": "pmtiles",
                    "display_name": "States",
                    "visible": true,
                    "default_style": {
                        "fill-color": "#000000",
                        "fill-opacity": 0
                    },
                    "outline_style": {
                        "line-color": "#263238",
                        "line-width": 1.2
                    },
                    "tooltip_fields": [
                        "NAME",
                        "STUSPS",
                        "GEOID"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "collection_id": "us-nlcd-2024",
            "collection_url": "/data/geo-data/stac/us-nlcd-2024/collection.json",
            "group": "Land cover",
            "assets": [
                {
                    "id": "cog",
                    "display_name": "Land cover (NLCD 2024)",
                    "visible": false,
                    "legend_type": "categorical",
                    "opacity": 0.75
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
